                  "id": "p-finding-right-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If resale value is part of your strategy, choosing the right trailer upfront matters. Whether you're searching for a dry van trailer for sale or evaluating a 53 ft dry van trailer, you want equipment that holds up over time and stays in demand. That's where working with the right partner makes a difference.",
