                {
                  "id": "p-why-hold-value-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There's a reason dry van trailers remain one of the most common trailer types on the road. They're versatile, reliable, and used across multiple industries. From retail goods to non-perishable freight, demand stays consistent. That steady demand helps support resale value, even as trailers age. It also means there's always a market when you're ready to sell or upgrade.",
