                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding dry van trailer resale value gives you an edge. It helps you plan smarter, spend wisely, and get more out of every piece of equipment you own. If you do that, your trailer won't just serve your business today; it will continue to deliver value when it's time for your next move. If you're ready to make a purchase, we're here to help. At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we don't just focus on the sale. We focus on helping you make the right decision for your business, both now and down the road.",
